JAPAN - Tanegashima Space Center

00:00:16.217 --> 00:00:17.652
Captain Caroline.

00:00:17.652 --> 00:00:20.422
5 days to go, and then we'll be in space.

00:00:20.422 --> 00:00:21.556
Yeah.

00:00:21.556 --> 00:00:24.793
At last, my childhood dream will come true.

00:00:24.793 --> 00:00:28.163
All that's left is to leave the Earth
behind and devote myself to the mission.

00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:29.994
No! You can't go yet!

00:00:30.098 --> 00:00:32.726
Because Koichi's still in this country, isn't he?!

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.505
Is... Is there someone inside of me?

00:00:39.607 --> 00:00:46.706
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:00:47.715 --> 00:00:53.585
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:56.024 --> 00:01:01.826
Meeting you like I did

00:01:02.163 --> 00:01:07.032
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:08.303 --> 00:01:13.832
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:01:14.242 --> 00:01:18.838
And surely change the future

00:01:19.447 --> 00:01:22.350
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:25.478
Is released (changing yourself)

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:31.354
An angel's shining surges through me

00:01:32.794 --> 00:01:35.363
The "wings" that will save the world

00:01:35.363 --> 00:01:38.196
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:44.599
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:01:44.739 --> 00:01:47.542
The power given to me

00:01:47.542 --> 00:01:50.178
Spurs me into the sky

00:01:50.178 --> 00:01:55.912
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:56.251 --> 00:02:01.780
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:09.831 --> 00:02:11.025
Okay, careful, now.

00:02:11.599 --> 00:02:12.700
Roger!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.531
The Children, released!

00:02:17.138 --> 00:02:18.973
No matter where you look, we're super cute!

00:02:18.973 --> 00:02:20.975
We're okay being the stars of a space opera!

00:02:20.975 --> 00:02:22.442
We'll save the day in the nick of time!

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:26.746
Stardust girls! The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:32.047
You're training for a
hypothetical mission in space.

00:02:32.687 --> 00:02:37.784
First, I want Kaoru to psychokinetically
remove that satellite from the cargo bay.

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:41.925
So, treat it as gently as you would a girl, right?

00:02:42.297 --> 00:02:44.891
Okay, that example's kind of creepy, but yes.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.065
PSYCHIC...

00:02:49.671 --> 00:02:52.040
"Please Milord, Don't!"

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.598
Don't you like it?

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:56.511
That's not gentle! That's sexual harassment!

00:02:56.511 --> 00:02:57.535
Calm down.

00:02:57.779 --> 00:02:59.881
But isn't there a play where that happens?

00:02:59.881 --> 00:03:00.609
Really?

00:03:00.682 --> 00:03:02.584
That lady's clearly spinning herself.

00:03:02.584 --> 00:03:04.211
That's hardly the point...

00:03:05.053 --> 00:03:07.422
You shouldn't blame Kaoru, Mr. Minamoto.

00:03:07.422 --> 00:03:12.126
We've hardly ever been treated like
normal girls, so how should we know?

00:03:12.126 --> 00:03:15.363
Exactly! And especially from
our direct superiors.

00:03:15.363 --> 00:03:19.094
Even though I think we've
gotten a lot more mature lately...

00:03:19.801 --> 00:03:20.802
Hm... 2 centimeters.

00:03:20.802 --> 00:03:22.599
Seriously?! Darn it...

00:03:22.937 --> 00:03:28.109
Yes. Step by step, you're climbing
the glass stairway to adulthood.

00:03:28.109 --> 00:03:30.612
Yes, even if it's only in H-2-0.

00:03:30.612 --> 00:03:32.136
Concentrate!

00:03:33.448 --> 00:03:35.814
43rd sense:
"The Oddly Perfect Couple!
Caroline, A Destined Reunion"

00:03:36.084 --> 00:03:37.142
LABORATORY

00:03:39.587 --> 00:03:41.256
Ew, my hair's damaged.

00:03:41.256 --> 00:03:43.884
Why do we need this training?

00:03:44.325 --> 00:03:47.658
Didn't you hear?
About the Japan-Comerica joint project?

00:03:47.895 --> 00:03:49.590
Japan and Comerica?

00:03:49.764 --> 00:03:50.822
Exactly.

00:03:51.733 --> 00:03:55.837
The construction of the international
moon station is about to begin.

00:03:55.837 --> 00:03:57.634
International moon station?

00:03:58.206 --> 00:03:59.574
Don't you know about it?

00:03:59.574 --> 00:04:02.134
They're about to launch a shuttle for it.

00:04:02.644 --> 00:04:04.805
I don't care about stuff like that.

00:04:05.613 --> 00:04:09.217
We continue now with coverage
of the upcoming shuttle launch...

00:04:09.217 --> 00:04:09.884
Well, speak of the devil.
We continue now with coverage
of the upcoming shuttle launch...

00:04:09.884 --> 00:04:11.586
Well, speak of the devil.
in 5 days for the construction
of the international moon station.

00:04:11.586 --> 00:04:14.180
in 5 days for the construction
of the international moon station.

00:04:14.322 --> 00:04:16.291
The woman, Caroline McGee,
is a Level 2 psychokinetic.

00:04:16.291 --> 00:04:17.191
Caroline...
The woman, Caroline McGee,
is a Level 2 psychokinetic.

00:04:17.191 --> 00:04:18.526
The woman, Caroline McGee,
is a Level 2 psychokinetic.

00:04:18.526 --> 00:04:22.030
She's one of the crew who
will be studying the effects...

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:22.697
of long-duration space
missions on psychic powers.

00:04:22.697 --> 00:04:23.731
80 cm. B-cup.
of long-duration space
missions on psychic powers.

00:04:23.731 --> 00:04:25.392
Okay, she's kind of pretty, but...
of long-duration space
missions on psychic powers.

00:04:26.067 --> 00:04:26.931
Friend of yours?

00:04:27.235 --> 00:04:30.329
Well, yes, but... No.

00:04:32.373 --> 00:04:33.641
You can't fool us!

00:04:33.641 --> 00:04:34.676
Cheater!

00:04:34.676 --> 00:04:35.877
You creep!

00:04:35.877 --> 00:04:37.712
This isn't any business of little kids!

00:04:37.712 --> 00:04:38.804
Little kids?!

00:04:42.383 --> 00:04:43.577
Wh-What?

00:04:46.688 --> 00:04:48.122
This is Doubleface.

00:04:48.122 --> 00:04:51.285
Serious damage at the entrance!
Looks like someone has broken in!

00:04:51.626 --> 00:04:55.221
High probability the intruder is
an esper! Be on alert!

00:04:55.496 --> 00:04:57.123
The intruder's an esper?

00:05:12.747 --> 00:05:13.805
Koichi.

00:05:14.615 --> 00:05:15.479
Caroline?

00:05:15.817 --> 00:05:16.818
It's her.

00:05:16.818 --> 00:05:18.219
The girl from the TV?

00:05:18.219 --> 00:05:20.119
Why is she here?

00:05:31.366 --> 00:05:33.067
M-Mr. Minamoto?

00:05:33.067 --> 00:05:35.370
Seems a little overly friendly, huh?

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.669
Busting in on our turf...
You've got some nerve!

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:43.778
What is this?!

00:05:43.778 --> 00:05:45.405
A powerful psychic wave!

00:05:47.815 --> 00:05:51.686
This isn't right!
They said she's a Level 2 esper!

00:05:51.686 --> 00:05:53.620
She's Level 6. No! Level 7!

00:05:54.756 --> 00:05:56.383
Can it be? Are you?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.750
Stop it, Carry!

00:06:01.396 --> 00:06:02.454
Carry?

00:06:05.266 --> 00:06:06.233
Koichi.

00:06:06.701 --> 00:06:08.532
Minamoto? Get away from her!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.158
Minamoto.

00:06:30.158 --> 00:06:31.859
Who is that woman?

00:06:31.859 --> 00:06:33.793
Please, look at me! Hey!

00:06:34.429 --> 00:06:35.555
Minamoto!

00:06:36.497 --> 00:06:38.124
Kaoru, you're awake.

00:06:39.801 --> 00:06:41.166
Where am I?

00:06:41.636 --> 00:06:42.694
Aoi. Shiho.

00:06:43.337 --> 00:06:45.306
Just lay quietly and rest.

00:06:45.306 --> 00:06:48.075
Well, there's nothing physically
wrong with you three, but...

00:06:48.075 --> 00:06:50.168
Minamoto. Where's Minamoto?

00:06:50.678 --> 00:06:52.447
A team, reporting.

00:06:52.447 --> 00:06:55.473
Pursuing escaped female esper.
Still uncaptured.

00:06:55.917 --> 00:06:57.418
B team reports the same.

00:06:57.418 --> 00:06:58.544
C team, as well.

00:06:58.786 --> 00:07:01.346
I don't get it. Why would Minamoto?

00:07:01.823 --> 00:07:03.848
We have a response from
the Comerican embassy.

00:07:04.292 --> 00:07:06.627
Captain Caroline was working on the project...

00:07:06.627 --> 00:07:09.255
at the space center with no problems, and then...

00:07:09.597 --> 00:07:13.260
It would seem the Comericans
want to hide something from us.

00:07:13.801 --> 00:07:15.063
So it would.

00:07:15.436 --> 00:07:16.494
Mr. Minamoto...

00:07:16.971 --> 00:07:18.768
All this time he was with us...

00:07:20.508 --> 00:07:23.945
But for Level 7's like you to
have been beaten like this...

00:07:23.945 --> 00:07:26.013
What were they like?

00:07:26.013 --> 00:07:27.037
Koichi!

00:07:28.249 --> 00:07:30.551
Dr. Sakaki, do you know anything about this?

00:07:30.551 --> 00:07:31.919
N-No...

00:07:31.919 --> 00:07:33.750
So, it was her, wasn't it?

00:07:34.088 --> 00:07:35.289
Hey! What are you?!

00:07:35.289 --> 00:07:37.120
Our limiters are released.

00:07:37.725 --> 00:07:38.693
Never mind that!

00:07:38.693 --> 00:07:40.092
Why do you sound like you know who she is?!

00:07:40.361 --> 00:07:41.829
That's right!

00:07:41.829 --> 00:07:42.463
Remember?

00:07:42.463 --> 00:07:45.633
There was a woman when you
were in Comerica, wasn't there?!

00:07:45.633 --> 00:07:46.567
Tell me!

00:07:46.567 --> 00:07:47.864
She and him...

00:07:48.803 --> 00:07:51.439
That's who this "Carry" woman is?

00:07:51.439 --> 00:07:52.807
Carry?

00:07:52.807 --> 00:07:55.002
Did he actually call her that, Kaoru?!

00:07:55.343 --> 00:07:56.537
Y-Yeah.

00:07:58.112 --> 00:07:59.847
What's going on here?

00:07:59.847 --> 00:08:01.109
Dr. Sakaki.

00:08:01.482 --> 00:08:03.950
If you know something, please tell us.

00:08:04.952 --> 00:08:05.919
Okay.

00:08:08.789 --> 00:08:10.057
Carry?

00:08:10.057 --> 00:08:11.991
What do you mean, Sakaki?

00:08:12.326 --> 00:08:15.263
Isn't she Captain Caroline McGee?

00:08:15.263 --> 00:08:18.666
This all started back when we were
studying abroad in Comerica.

00:08:18.666 --> 00:08:21.635
That's when you and he...

00:08:21.702 --> 00:08:24.068
You became friends at the university, right?

00:08:24.338 --> 00:08:25.134
Right.

00:08:35.983 --> 00:08:37.177
Awake now?

00:08:37.752 --> 00:08:39.617
Sakaki-san...

00:08:40.421 --> 00:08:41.911
Just call me Sakaki.

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:46.358
We'd finished our required courses and
were preparing to return to Japan.

00:08:46.961 --> 00:08:49.964
Minamoto! You've gotta do this, Minamoto!

00:08:49.964 --> 00:08:54.799
If you come, Amelia, Won Lee, Jodi,
Kris, and Kushanna will, too!

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:59.399
What's your real reason for getting
the international students together?

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.610
What do you think? For one last group date!

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:06.380
I'm still a minor! I can't get involved in that!

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:09.150
Oh, loosen up! This is Comerica.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.380
This is a matter of personal freedom...

00:09:11.519 --> 00:09:13.387
Look, we have to work hard...

00:09:13.387 --> 00:09:17.325
to change the image of the
shy Japanese person, right?

00:09:17.325 --> 00:09:18.485
And be like you?

00:09:18.826 --> 00:09:22.193
Come on, you were born a man, so...

00:09:28.069 --> 00:09:32.529
Ow... Hey! That's dangerous,
blocking the way like that!

00:09:33.641 --> 00:09:34.903
Sorry.

00:09:40.381 --> 00:09:44.218
Sorry, Caroline. Shall I take you
out tonight as an apology?

00:09:44.218 --> 00:09:45.344
Oh, Shuji.

00:09:45.586 --> 00:09:50.614
Oh-ho... Is this another plan
for you to pick up girls?

00:09:51.692 --> 00:09:56.430
You lost your shy image a long
time ago on this campus.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:57.556
Who's he?

00:09:57.865 --> 00:09:59.533
Koichi Minamoto.

00:09:59.533 --> 00:10:02.536
I'm also Japanese, but please
don't assume I'm like him.

00:10:02.536 --> 00:10:03.434
Shut up!

00:10:03.804 --> 00:10:05.931
A pleasure. I'm Caroline.

00:10:08.275 --> 00:10:09.944
A pleasure.

00:10:09.944 --> 00:10:11.775
So, you free tonight?

00:10:12.046 --> 00:10:15.413
Sorry. I'll be helping out Professor Wonlens.

00:10:15.883 --> 00:10:20.547
The professor? You're a Level 2
psychokinetic, aren't you?

00:10:20.888 --> 00:10:22.590
Oh? Really?

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:26.321
Typical Shuji. You have data
on every girl, don't you?

00:10:26.627 --> 00:10:29.858
Don't joke, Caroline! You're helping
him in those experiments?

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:35.336
That's a rumor! I'm just taking
his advice on my career choice.

00:10:35.336 --> 00:10:36.462
Career choice?

00:10:36.704 --> 00:10:41.835
I want to go into space someday.
It's been my dream since childhood.

00:10:42.176 --> 00:10:44.111
Oh?

00:10:44.111 --> 00:10:46.477
Damn, look at the time. See you!

00:10:48.816 --> 00:10:51.419
Sakaki, what experiments?

00:10:51.419 --> 00:10:54.047
Well, it's just a rumor,

00:10:54.155 --> 00:10:56.724
but I've heard Prof. Wonlens
in the ESP research center...

00:10:56.724 --> 00:11:01.991
is using external stimulus on the brains of
low-level espers to increase their abilities.

00:11:03.297 --> 00:11:04.594
You mean she's?

00:11:11.939 --> 00:11:13.907
It came from the ESP research center!

00:11:33.828 --> 00:11:35.193
Minamoto!

00:11:41.035 --> 00:11:42.593
Caroline?

00:11:48.242 --> 00:11:50.478
I want you to understand.

00:11:50.478 --> 00:11:54.141
She participated in the experiment,
knowing the risk.

00:11:54.381 --> 00:11:57.118
With you dangling her post-grad career as bait?

00:11:57.118 --> 00:12:00.281
This school's a disgrace, Prof. Wonlens.

00:12:00.554 --> 00:12:02.954
Never mind that. What's happened to her?

00:12:03.557 --> 00:12:07.728
She's like a infant. That hurts. Please stop.

00:12:07.728 --> 00:12:08.729
Stop?

00:12:08.729 --> 00:12:10.698
As a result of the experiment,

00:12:10.698 --> 00:12:14.101
she's become a high-level esper
with combined powers.

00:12:14.101 --> 00:12:16.904
Unfortunately, her memories
and personality were lost.

00:12:16.904 --> 00:12:18.166
How?

00:12:19.807 --> 00:12:22.109
Hm... This is serious.

00:12:22.109 --> 00:12:24.805
When the psychic centers
in her brain were activated,

00:12:24.879 --> 00:12:26.904
it created a new personality.

00:12:27.181 --> 00:12:28.580
Then, Caroline's gone?!

00:12:31.986 --> 00:12:34.088
You're Minamoto, right?

00:12:34.088 --> 00:12:35.422
Y-Yes.

00:12:35.422 --> 00:12:36.980
Y-Yes!

00:12:37.858 --> 00:12:39.416
She cares for you a great deal, it seems.

00:12:40.494 --> 00:12:43.430
What? No, it's nothing like that.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:47.366
Minamoto, the man born to be a babysitter.

00:12:47.735 --> 00:12:52.006
How about it? Won't you help us
get her back to normal?

00:12:52.006 --> 00:12:53.374
Is there a way?

00:12:53.374 --> 00:12:56.210
If we can join both personalities into one.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:13:01.649
In short, if we can combine their brain functions,

00:13:02.216 --> 00:13:03.984
But, you don't need me for that.

00:13:03.984 --> 00:13:05.952
No, we can't do it alone.

00:13:07.388 --> 00:13:08.320
She...

00:13:11.559 --> 00:13:15.462
She's extremely shy.
Apparently, she doesn't like us much.

00:13:15.462 --> 00:13:18.165
That's what caused the explosion last night.

00:13:18.165 --> 00:13:20.998
Please! We don't want her to
wreck the entire university!

00:13:25.139 --> 00:13:28.075
That hurts! Please, stop it, Caroline.

00:13:28.075 --> 00:13:29.440
Carry-line?

00:13:29.877 --> 00:13:32.580
That's right. She doesn't
even know her own name.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.911
It's Caroline.

00:13:34.215 --> 00:13:35.316
Carry-lin?

00:13:35.316 --> 00:13:36.116
Caroline.

00:13:36.116 --> 00:13:36.984
Carryn?

00:13:36.984 --> 00:13:37.852
Caroline.

00:13:37.852 --> 00:13:38.841
Carry!

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:42.823
Carry! Carry! Carry!

00:13:42.823 --> 00:13:47.317
I guess Carry will do for now. Okay, I'll help you.

00:13:48.229 --> 00:13:49.897
However, on one condition.

00:13:49.897 --> 00:13:50.955
Condition?

00:13:51.532 --> 00:13:55.035
I want you to stop your research
on creating high-level espers...

00:13:55.035 --> 00:13:56.935
so that this never happens again!

00:13:58.072 --> 00:13:59.869
I promise.

00:14:01.442 --> 00:14:03.344
She is absolutely huge, isn't she?

00:14:03.344 --> 00:14:04.902
This is Comerica, after all.

00:14:06.447 --> 00:14:09.143
Yuichi Nakamura is sensitive to the heat.

00:14:11.485 --> 00:14:13.220
But Koichi isn't coming, is he?

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:16.257
Well, you'd better just forget about him.

00:14:16.257 --> 00:14:19.454
Minamoto isn't interested in grownup women.

00:14:19.793 --> 00:14:22.125
Quit spreading weird stories about me!

00:14:22.429 --> 00:14:23.631
Hi, Koichi!

00:14:23.631 --> 00:14:24.097
Hi!

00:14:27.234 --> 00:14:28.836
A kid's book?

00:14:28.836 --> 00:14:29.803
It's Carry's.

00:14:29.803 --> 00:14:31.171
Who's Carry?

00:14:31.171 --> 00:14:33.107
Did you get a job as a babysitter?

00:14:33.107 --> 00:14:34.942
No, it's his thing for kids...

00:14:34.942 --> 00:14:37.001
Why do you enjoy doing that?!

00:14:42.616 --> 00:14:44.481
Koichi!

00:14:45.119 --> 00:14:47.087
Let's play! Let's play! Let's play!

00:14:49.523 --> 00:14:50.649
St-Stop that.

00:14:51.191 --> 00:14:53.327
You promised we'd read a book today.

00:14:53.327 --> 00:14:54.561
No books!

00:14:54.561 --> 00:14:56.495
Carry wants to play dodge ball!

00:14:58.632 --> 00:14:59.758
With that ball?

00:15:00.034 --> 00:15:02.229
Yeah, like this!

00:15:04.038 --> 00:15:07.633
No, I don't think we should play that.
You'll end up killing us.

00:15:08.142 --> 00:15:09.769
First, we read the book.

00:15:11.111 --> 00:15:13.579
No, no, no! Play!

00:15:14.315 --> 00:15:16.306
The fastest way to integrate
your brain functions...

00:15:16.417 --> 00:15:19.219
will be by developing your language skills.

00:15:19.219 --> 00:15:21.779
If Carry gets smart, Carry will disappear!

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:24.725
No, you won't disappear.

00:15:24.725 --> 00:15:29.096
You'll merge with your original personality.
It just means you'll go back to normal!

00:15:29.096 --> 00:15:33.634
You'll keep your psychokinesis and won't
lose any of the memories you have now.

00:15:33.634 --> 00:15:36.762
But Carry will be different! Carry will disappear!

00:15:37.805 --> 00:15:39.705
Carry doesn't want to disappear!

00:15:40.808 --> 00:15:41.775
Carry...

00:15:41.775 --> 00:15:47.680
Listen to me, Carry. People grow,
and growing means changing.

00:15:47.748 --> 00:15:49.817
Usually, it happens so slowly you don't notice,

00:15:49.817 --> 00:15:52.453
but, every day, bit by bit we're
all changing into someone new.

00:15:52.453 --> 00:15:54.021
Our minds and our bodies.

00:15:54.021 --> 00:15:57.081
Besides, if you stay like this,
what about Caroline?

00:15:57.291 --> 00:15:59.623
Does Koichi like Caroline?

00:15:59.727 --> 00:16:03.424
Do you like Caroline more than Carry?
Do you hate Carry?

00:16:03.697 --> 00:16:06.860
No, I don't. I just...

00:16:07.034 --> 00:16:09.536
You shouldn't trouble Minamoto like that, Carry.

00:16:09.536 --> 00:16:13.802
He wants you to grow up.
It's for everyone's sake.

00:16:13.974 --> 00:16:15.943
Then, when Carry's a grownup...

00:16:15.943 --> 00:16:18.969
When Carry's bigger, will you marry her?!

00:16:23.317 --> 00:16:25.853
We'll have to wait and see.

00:16:25.853 --> 00:16:27.688
Then Carry will grow up!

00:16:27.688 --> 00:16:30.919
When Carry grows up, you'll love her!

00:16:31.091 --> 00:16:34.788
Then you won't talk about Carry
turning back to Caroline!

00:16:37.131 --> 00:16:39.233
I'm starting to get the picture.

00:16:39.233 --> 00:16:40.222
Yeah, I see.

00:16:40.534 --> 00:16:44.204
And a little later, she and
Mr. Minamoto started dating, right?

00:16:44.204 --> 00:16:45.706
Mr. Minamoto, you creep!

00:16:45.706 --> 00:16:49.143
A girl he was taking care of,
and he won't even try that with us?!

00:16:49.143 --> 00:16:51.111
No, it's not fair.

00:16:51.111 --> 00:16:54.080
But now I have a better opinion of Minamoto.

00:16:54.481 --> 00:16:56.016
Please don't make light of this!

00:16:56.016 --> 00:16:56.950
Director...

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:00.044
What happened? What happened to Carry?

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.414
Kaoru?

00:17:01.922 --> 00:17:05.722
Carry's mind grew to match her
body faster than we anticipated.

00:17:06.393 --> 00:17:08.918
Yeah... It only took about a month.

00:17:14.668 --> 00:17:16.829
Where am I?

00:17:18.839 --> 00:17:21.137
Are you awake now, Koichi?

00:17:26.213 --> 00:17:29.239
Carry? Is that you?

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:32.685
Yeah! Koichi! I missed you.

00:17:34.088 --> 00:17:35.988
It's Carry, all right.

00:17:36.857 --> 00:17:39.417
But, it can't be. Back then, she was!

00:17:42.796 --> 00:17:43.558
Carry!

00:17:49.736 --> 00:17:53.467
I learned to read German today.
Tomorrow, I'll study French.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.607
Really.

00:17:55.075 --> 00:17:58.238
But I have a feeling it's not me who's learning it.

00:17:58.912 --> 00:18:01.972
I wonder if it's all Caroline's mind doing it.

00:18:02.082 --> 00:18:02.776
Carry...

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:06.920
There are times I remember a person's
face or a place I don't know.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:09.089
I'll disappear soon, won't I?

00:18:09.089 --> 00:18:13.560
I keep telling you, you won't vanish. You'll just...

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:17.018
I'll just change, right? But I can tell.

00:18:17.498 --> 00:18:19.032
I'm disappearing.

00:18:19.032 --> 00:18:21.728
Because you're everything in the world to me.

00:18:22.169 --> 00:18:25.161
My love for you is all that I am.

00:18:27.207 --> 00:18:30.734
When Caroline returns, she won't
love you in the same way.

00:18:31.145 --> 00:18:35.081
She's not like me. She has a past
and memories that don't involve you.

00:18:35.816 --> 00:18:39.775
At the very least, she'll still think you're cute.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:45.187
But I think her dream of going into
space is most important to her.

00:18:45.759 --> 00:18:51.031
That's why I won't merge with her.
Or, rather, I don't want to.

00:18:51.031 --> 00:18:54.159
I want to keep these feelings for myself.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.933
Koichi, please...
Will you give me one last memory?

00:19:01.108 --> 00:19:02.405
Goodbye.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:14.715
Back then, I thought that Carry chose
to seal herself away and fall asleep.

00:19:15.756 --> 00:19:17.883
Why are you here?

00:19:18.325 --> 00:19:22.963
I don't know. But I missed you, Koichi!

00:19:22.963 --> 00:19:25.932
Has she not regained all of her memories yet?

00:19:27.401 --> 00:19:28.735
Great.

00:19:28.735 --> 00:19:31.863
I come to see what sort of
esper had awakened here...

00:19:32.039 --> 00:19:34.940
and find the kid involved in this, too.

00:19:35.075 --> 00:19:37.202
Interesting.

00:19:38.979 --> 00:19:41.607
I see. Carry did that to herself.

00:19:41.782 --> 00:19:42.908
Yeah.

00:19:43.717 --> 00:19:46.550
Chief, emergency report from D Team!

00:19:47.354 --> 00:19:51.154
This is Tokiwa. Have sighted
It. Minamoto and Capt. Caroline.

00:19:52.259 --> 00:19:56.230
Hold it... This mind... It's not Caroline.
It's someone named "Carry"...

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:58.665
Huh? What do you mean?

00:19:58.665 --> 00:20:02.465
Anyway, Minamoto is all right.
No sign of any injuries.

00:20:03.036 --> 00:20:03.804
Aoi!

00:20:03.804 --> 00:20:05.305
Gotcha!

00:20:05.305 --> 00:20:06.863
Wha! Girls, wait!

00:20:07.341 --> 00:20:09.241
They went after them.

00:20:10.911 --> 00:20:13.106
Yes? This is the chief's office.

00:20:14.081 --> 00:20:14.843
Director!

00:20:19.086 --> 00:20:21.919
Minamoto, this is Nowaki. Stay where you are.

00:20:22.256 --> 00:20:23.590
R-Right.

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:25.285
Please give her to us!

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:27.151
Ken!

00:20:27.594 --> 00:20:30.188
Mary! Colonel Grisham!

00:20:32.766 --> 00:20:34.334
Wh-What are you doing?

00:20:34.334 --> 00:20:38.270
Don't worry! We're not here to hurt anyone!

00:20:38.805 --> 00:20:43.333
No... Comerica's restarted its high-level esper
development experiments, hasn't it?!

00:20:43.844 --> 00:20:47.803
The details are top secret,
but this is of national concern to us...

00:20:47.881 --> 00:20:51.044
and the Japanese government approves.
It's nothing personal.

00:20:55.956 --> 00:20:56.957
Hold it!

00:20:56.957 --> 00:20:58.225
What's with the gun?!

00:20:58.225 --> 00:20:59.593
What's the meaning of this?!

00:20:59.593 --> 00:21:01.495
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:21:01.495 --> 00:21:04.726
But we're soldiers, and we can't disobey orders!

00:21:04.831 --> 00:21:08.735
We're friends, but we won't allow you to defy us!

00:21:08.735 --> 00:21:12.105
What's yours is ours and what's ours is still ours!

00:21:12.105 --> 00:21:14.374
What kind of one-sided friendship is that?!

00:21:14.374 --> 00:21:15.705
Koichi!

00:21:23.317 --> 00:21:24.147
Again?!

00:21:32.926 --> 00:21:35.258
She teleported?

00:21:35.662 --> 00:21:37.197
Stop!

00:21:37.197 --> 00:21:38.027
Our limiters!

00:21:38.198 --> 00:21:39.392
They've been turned on!

00:21:40.467 --> 00:21:42.069
Stay where you are, Children.

00:21:42.069 --> 00:21:43.001
Granny!

00:21:43.203 --> 00:21:46.006
We just got a call from the prime minister.

00:21:46.006 --> 00:21:48.873
He wants us to leave this matter
entirely to the Comericans.

00:21:49.076 --> 00:21:51.442
We appreciate your cooperation.

00:21:52.746 --> 00:21:54.915
Granny, why are you stopping us?!

00:21:54.915 --> 00:21:58.118
Any interference, and even
you girls will be arrested...

00:21:58.118 --> 00:22:00.985
and charged with violations of international law.

00:22:01.121 --> 00:22:02.356
Arrested?!

00:22:02.356 --> 00:22:03.789
You'd do that to us?!

00:22:04.324 --> 00:22:07.054
I see you won't understand
unless I show you I'm serious.

00:22:11.498 --> 00:22:12.866
What is this?!

00:22:12.866 --> 00:22:13.934
What's the meaning of this?!

00:22:13.934 --> 00:22:15.401
What's the deal, Granny?!

00:22:15.936 --> 00:22:17.267
Granny!

00:22:30.884 --> 00:22:34.521
I turn to the front, embracing the dream

00:22:34.521 --> 00:22:38.492
Making up my mind, looking up to the sky

00:22:38.492 --> 00:22:44.564
I'll fly beyond the future with my wings

00:22:44.564 --> 00:22:48.435
You alone are my heart's desire!

00:22:48.435 --> 00:22:52.406
I declared that I love you absolutely

00:22:52.406 --> 00:22:58.311
As the shining seasons pass

00:22:59.045 --> 00:23:03.083
Your face is still as troubled as in

00:23:03.083 --> 00:23:06.951
The photos I took to remember those days

00:23:07.554 --> 00:23:13.789
As I shed warm, gentle tears

00:23:14.995 --> 00:23:18.565
Let's try to meet here tomorrow, too

00:23:18.565 --> 00:23:22.135
Without making promises, let's go

00:23:22.135 --> 00:23:26.106
As casually as always

00:23:26.106 --> 00:23:31.339
Waving my little hand with a smile

00:23:32.345 --> 00:23:37.146
"Bye bye, till we meet again"

00:23:50.430 --> 00:23:50.897
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:50.897 --> 00:23:51.965
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:51.965 --> 00:23:52.863
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:53.099 --> 00:23:54.701
Listen to me, Carry! We!

00:23:54.701 --> 00:23:57.370
I've always wanted to see the
country where you were born!

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:58.104
Carry...

00:23:58.104 --> 00:24:01.908
If Mr. Minamoto chooses Carry,
then what happens to us?

00:24:01.908 --> 00:24:02.742
Aoi...

00:24:02.742 --> 00:24:05.745
I dunno, but I can't just stand by and do nothing!

00:24:05.745 --> 00:24:06.980
I won't!

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:08.548
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:08.548 --> 00:24:12.018
Episode 44: "Painful Parting!
Goodbye Forever, Carry."

00:24:12.018 --> 00:24:13.887
I was the one who wanted wings!

00:24:13.887 --> 00:24:16.656
Even though I had to conceal it from you!

00:24:16.656 --> 00:24:16.756
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:16.756 --> 00:24:18.658
Painful Parting!
Goodbye Forever, Carry
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:18.658 --> 00:24:19.955
Painful Parting!
Goodbye Forever, Carry
